LOCUS       pDEMO_REX               2800 bp    DNA     circular SYN 01-JAN-2026
DEFINITION  Synthetic demo plasmid for Restriction Enzyme Explorer.
ACCESSION   pDEMO_REX
COMMENT     Demonstration construct. The T7 promoter, lac operator, RBS, MCS sites,
            His6 tag and T7 terminator are real short sequences; the insert ORF, AmpR
            and ori are random placeholders and are not from any published plasmid.
FEATURES             Location/Qualifiers
     source          1..2800
                     /organism="synthetic construct"
     promoter        101..120
                     /label="T7 promoter"
     protein_bind    121..141
                     /label="lac operator"
     RBS             160..173
                     /label="RBS"
     misc_feature    200..271
                     /label="MCS"
     misc_feature    275..292
                     /label="His6 tag"
     CDS             299..1078
                     /label="insert ORF"
     terminator      1099..1145
                     /label="T7 terminator"
     CDS             complement(1600..2460)
                     /label="AmpR"
     rep_origin      complement(2480..2740)
                     /label="ori"
     misc_feature    join(2761..2800,1..100)
                     /label="backbone"
